+
+| | bodies | SKUs | |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| round | 43 | 316 | lathe, unblocked |
+| boxy | 27 | 509 | girth axis unsettled, see below |
+| sculpted | 5 | 386 | outside modeler |
+| unresolved | 12 | 62 | shape unknown |
